(7539658, 1206544, 163081, '<td valign="top">Great mood, I like that misty background trees. Why didn''t you go for a B&amp;W editing? Also a 5% crop of the foreground. Still a strong image.<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173263" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg"/></a>  An 8 from me and my Yellow Dragon Award</td>', 'Great mood, I like that misty background trees. Why didn''t you go for a B&W editing? Also a 5% crop of the foreground. Still a strong image.  An 8 from me and my Yellow Dragon Award', '2017-10-18 10:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539660, 1206786, 163081, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing in this scene. looks like a half rat staring at me on the left. The green makes it even more alienate. A 9 from me and my Red Dragon Award. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173262" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I really like the processing in this scene. looks like a half rat staring at me on the left. The green makes it even more alienate. A 9 from me and my Red Dragon Award. ', '2017-10-18 10:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
