(7539704, 1206621, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stellar. Talk about anchoring a shot! Lovely leading lines, silhouette, water, textures. Perfect level of contrast.  With an added sprinkling of little birds at the very edge.</td>', 'Stellar. Talk about anchoring a shot! Lovely leading lines, silhouette, water, textures. Perfect level of contrast.  With an added sprinkling of little birds at the very edge.', '2017-10-18 14:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
