(7539792, 1206898, 19959, '<td valign="top">Top quality Entry. Should make the Top 3 IMO.<br/> <br/>This has a lot of impact and you spent some time with concept and execution. Processing is not over-done. I''m going to be really picky here an point out the apparent mirroring in the ''steam''  for some reason this caught my attention.</td>', 'Top quality Entry. Should make the Top 3 IMO. This has a lot of impact and you spent some time with concept and execution. Processing is not over-done. I''m going to be really picky here an point out the apparent mirroring in the ''steam''  for some reason this caught my attention.', '2017-10-19 08:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
