(7539797, 1206488, 19959, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is what DPC is all about. A creative interpretation of the challenge executed to a high standard. This made me smile and stands out. I would be surprised if this did not make the Ribbons.<br/> <br/>I might have been tempted to crop a little tighter at the base to add impact and focus on the subjects.. the matching expressions on man and dog are the hook. Good Luck...</td>', 'Now THIS is what DPC is all about. A creative interpretation of the challenge executed to a high standard. This made me smile and stands out. I would be surprised if this did not make the Ribbons. I might have been tempted to crop a little tighter at the base to add impact and focus on the subjects.. the matching expressions on man and dog are the hook. Good Luck...', '2017-10-19 08:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
