(7540670, 1206898, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sizzling image that pounds out rock and roll fantasy.  Wonderfully set up and achieved.  A ribbon winner for sure.</td>', 'Sizzling image that pounds out rock and roll fantasy.  Wonderfully set up and achieved.  A ribbon winner for sure.', '2017-10-24 17:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540671, 1206861, 173844, '<td valign="top">An incredible image and memorial to Tom.  I love how intent and peaceful he looks sitting at the head of all that power and excitement.  The florid colors are handled with admirable restraint and greatly contribute to the overall intensity.  A for sure ribbon winner.</td>', 'An incredible image and memorial to Tom.  I love how intent and peaceful he looks sitting at the head of all that power and excitement.  The florid colors are handled with admirable restraint and greatly contribute to the overall intensity.  A for sure ribbon winner.', '2017-10-24 17:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540672, 1206786, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really interesting image that does lend a feeling of mental disintegration, in the bad sense.  The green that pushes inward is acidic, the brown walls seem to fade away, losing integrity.  Terrific.</td>', 'Really interesting image that does lend a feeling of mental disintegration, in the bad sense.  The green that pushes inward is acidic, the brown walls seem to fade away, losing integrity.  Terrific.', '2017-10-24 17:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540673, 1206904, 173844, '<td valign="top">A consummate depiction of these lyrics.  Intricate, precise, draws the eye right to the dazzling bottom and center --  which actually seems to be the top, lit like an epiphany.  I like how the left corner, extending across the bottom right, is very dark, providing a visual anchor, a platform from which to leap.</td>', 'A consummate depiction of these lyrics.  Intricate, precise, draws the eye right to the dazzling bottom and center --  which actually seems to be the top, lit like an epiphany.  I like how the left corner, extending across the bottom right, is very dark, providing a visual anchor, a platform from which to leap.', '2017-10-24 18:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540677, 1206587, 173844, '<td valign="top">A lovely, distinctive and stylized portrait.  I really like the flow of the line along her arm, hand and face, an interesting visual exploration. The colors of her clothing are nicely extended in the blush of her skin, her lips and fingernails.</td>', 'A lovely, distinctive and stylized portrait.  I really like the flow of the line along her arm, hand and face, an interesting visual exploration. The colors of her clothing are nicely extended in the blush of her skin, her lips and fingernails.', '2017-10-24 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540684, 1206879, 173844, '<td valign="top">A nice waterfall image.  What I especially appreciate is the generous foreground that allows the story freedom to develop.  It''s one thing to fall; it''s important, too, to understand what''s downriver.  The focus, here, on the rock and beautiful leaves affords reassurance and hope.</td>', 'A nice waterfall image.  What I especially appreciate is the generous foreground that allows the story freedom to develop.  It''s one thing to fall; it''s important, too, to understand what''s downriver.  The focus, here, on the rock and beautiful leaves affords reassurance and hope.', '2017-10-24 18:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
