(7540735, 1206903, 185714, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2017-10-24 22:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540740, 1206743, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, beautiful processing, beautifully tender.  A garden of tone and emotion.<br/>Can''t help but evoke elephants'' horrible slaughter in pursuit of these very tusks for art, trinkets and oriental potions.  Sorry to yoke these two sentences together when what I really want to do is celebrate this image and this particular elephant.  <br/>By far my favorite image in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image, beautiful processing, beautifully tender.  A garden of tone and emotion.Can''t help but evoke elephants'' horrible slaughter in pursuit of these very tusks for art, trinkets and oriental potions.  Sorry to yoke these two sentences together when what I really want to do is celebrate this image and this particular elephant.  By far my favorite image in this challenge.', '2017-10-24 23:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540741, 1206785, 173844, '<td valign="top">A remarkable image that is both mysterious and explicit.  What a wonderful setting for this evocative figure.  I really don''t even know if this is exultation or pain.  To use the word a second time, a remarkable achievement.</td>', 'A remarkable image that is both mysterious and explicit.  What a wonderful setting for this evocative figure.  I really don''t even know if this is exultation or pain.  To use the word a second time, a remarkable achievement.', '2017-10-24 23:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540743, 1206823, 173844, '<td valign="top">A nice candid shot of these three women behind a fence.  It captures their individualities well.  There is this sense of a Greek chorus telling a story, setting up the background of the swirling world.  There''s a certain tension here, as I wonder if the woman on the left is participating or observing.</td>', 'A nice candid shot of these three women behind a fence.  It captures their individualities well.  There is this sense of a Greek chorus telling a story, setting up the background of the swirling world.  There''s a certain tension here, as I wonder if the woman on the left is participating or observing.', '2017-10-24 23:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540744, 1206637, 173844, '<td valign="top">Evocative image, dark with a knife blade of light.  I find it rather oppressive, but that''s not to take away from it''s power and worth.  Well done.</td>', 'Evocative image, dark with a knife blade of light.  I find it rather oppressive, but that''s not to take away from it''s power and worth.  Well done.', '2017-10-24 23:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540745, 1206544, 173844, '<td valign="top">Drawing from your title, I do feel the anticipation expressed here.  Don''t know, however, if it''s excitement or rest ahead.  In any case, with the moon and calm water, it suits my fancy to pull up the blanket of mist and settle to bed.  A fine image of generous invitation.</td>', 'Drawing from your title, I do feel the anticipation expressed here.  Don''t know, however, if it''s excitement or rest ahead.  In any case, with the moon and calm water, it suits my fancy to pull up the blanket of mist and settle to bed.  A fine image of generous invitation.', '2017-10-24 23:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540753, 1206899, 173844, '<td valign="top">Calming and enchanting.  This looks like a post card from the 1920''s.  It''s ripe for hand tinting.  The heavy grain and lovely monochrome play a good part in the overall character of the image.  I enjoy the sense of balance here, the fine composition.  It feels timeless.</td>', 'Calming and enchanting.  This looks like a post card from the 1920''s.  It''s ripe for hand tinting.  The heavy grain and lovely monochrome play a good part in the overall character of the image.  I enjoy the sense of balance here, the fine composition.  It feels timeless.', '2017-10-24 23:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540754, 1206561, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image of this stream, fronted by a modest curtain of, what else, green streamers.  Great depth, allowing the viewer to work his/her way upstream and long for beyond.  Elegant composition.</td>', 'Lovely image of this stream, fronted by a modest curtain of, what else, green streamers.  Great depth, allowing the viewer to work his/her way upstream and long for beyond.  Elegant composition.', '2017-10-24 23:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540755, 1206666, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine overview, I''m guessing drone.  This certainly fits the title.  Great lines, light and color.  With a double rainbow almost an afterthought, who can resist this elegant image?</td>', 'Fine overview, I''m guessing drone.  This certainly fits the title.  Great lines, light and color.  With a double rainbow almost an afterthought, who can resist this elegant image?', '2017-10-25 00:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540756, 1206869, 38032, '<td valign="top">DIFFERENT. tops.</td>', 'DIFFERENT. tops.', '2017-10-25 00:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7540757, 1206902, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine image of that long road.  The colors and atmosphere blend harmoniously.  Also, there''s that nuance of traveling through wilderness, another metaphor for love''s difficulties, beauty and intricacy.  Modest and well done.</td>', 'Fine image of that long road.  The colors and atmosphere blend harmoniously.  Also, there''s that nuance of traveling through wilderness, another metaphor for love''s difficulties, beauty and intricacy.  Modest and well done.', '2017-10-25 00:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
