(7540764, 1206907, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fascinating and imaginative image.  Is that the sun and corona on the bottom or up top?  The bird gives the viewer something realistic to grab, yet it, too, is part of the mystery.  The background lines look like fingerprints.  Challenging photograph.<br/>Might be some artifacts working against the whole.</td>', 'Fascinating and imaginative image.  Is that the sun and corona on the bottom or up top?  The bird gives the viewer something realistic to grab, yet it, too, is part of the mystery.  The background lines look like fingerprints.  Challenging photograph.Might be some artifacts working against the whole.', '2017-10-25 00:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
