(7540904, 1206621, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM, Deb. A really laid back image.</td>', 'Congrats on the HM, Deb. A really laid back image.', '2017-10-25 13:49:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7540905, 1206882, 52549, '<td valign="top">Certainly a beautiful image, congrats on the HM.</td>', 'Certainly a beautiful image, congrats on the HM.', '2017-10-25 13:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7540906, 1206823, 68504, '<td valign="top">captivating.</td>', 'captivating.', '2017-10-25 13:58:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7540915, 1206561, 141409, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Surprised this did so well. <br/> <br/>Currently subject to validation but hopefully no issues.  A branch running vertical about two thirds of the way across the image has been removed.  Apart from that pretty minor adjustments. Since this is Extended editing I''m hoping I''m in the clear!   <br/> <br/>Thanks for all the great comments.  I don''t use my camera anywhere near enough and this has given me some more incentive to get out there with my camera.</td>', 'Wow.  Surprised this did so well.  Currently subject to validation but hopefully no issues.  A branch running vertical about two thirds of the way across the image has been removed.  Apart from that pretty minor adjustments. Since this is Extended editing I''m hoping I''m in the clear!    Thanks for all the great comments.  I don''t use my camera anywhere near enough and this has given me some more incentive to get out there with my camera.', '2017-10-25 14:41:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7540916, 1206898, 141409, '<td valign="top">Congrats.  Nicely done, my fave of the challenge.</td>', 'Congrats.  Nicely done, my fave of the challenge.', '2017-10-25 14:41:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7540917, 1206621, 141409, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The simplicity and the leading lines really work.</td>', 'Love this.  The simplicity and the leading lines really work.', '2017-10-25 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7540918, 1206587, 141409, '<td valign="top">It''s a great portrait - lovely colours.</td>', 'It''s a great portrait - lovely colours.', '2017-10-25 14:47:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7540920, 1206745, 141409, '<td valign="top">This has grown on me.  I should have rated it higher in hindsight and had I got a chance to reappraise before voting ended I would have . Apologies. It''s great subject isolation and B&amp;W suits the image well.</td>', 'This has grown on me.  I should have rated it higher in hindsight and had I got a chance to reappraise before voting ended I would have . Apologies. It''s great subject isolation and B&W suits the image well.', '2017-10-25 15:18:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7540932, 1206861, 50695, '<td valign="top">For me, this was on the cusp between 4 and 5. I found the image a bit muddy. Pictures of trains generally are not that interesting to me. Trains are glorious creatures but usually aren''t transformed much by a camera. Your editing work to add sparks/smoke/perspective added a point to the score. To be honest, I didn''t notice the guy sitting on it. On my scale, a 3 is a meh photo that isn''t doing anything interesting. So I bumped it to a 4. Much like in real life, I generally give credit for the end result, not the work put into it.</td>', 'For me, this was on the cusp between 4 and 5. I found the image a bit muddy. Pictures of trains generally are not that interesting to me. Trains are glorious creatures but usually aren''t transformed much by a camera. Your editing work to add sparks/smoke/perspective added a point to the score. To be honest, I didn''t notice the guy sitting on it. On my scale, a 3 is a meh photo that isn''t doing anything interesting. So I bumped it to a 4. Much like in real life, I generally give credit for the end result, not the work put into it.', '2017-10-25 17:09:35.000000', NULL, 0);
