(7541281, 1206621, 67697, '<td valign="top">Whooo hoo Top 5!  Congrats!<br/></td>', 'Whooo hoo Top 5!  Congrats!', '2017-10-28 19:52:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541727, 1206861, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>A great image that contributes to the challenge well<br/> <br/>Well, it works for me Susan, a great image. Youve certainly generated some interesting critique, didnt notice the guy sitting on it!?! For me it is always the end result that Im interested in Im not really interested in what or how much work has gone into it but all credit to you for the amount of effort involved. Its original, I like the distortions, I like the sparks, most of all I like the excitement it generates with Tom driving it all along in his own cool way. Yes, it would look great as an album cover a great tribute to a great artist, well done Susan.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club A great image that contributes to the challenge well Well, it works for me Susan, a great image. Youve certainly generated some interesting critique, didnt notice the guy sitting on it!?! For me it is always the end result that Im interested in Im not really interested in what or how much work has gone into it but all credit to you for the amount of effort involved. Its original, I like the distortions, I like the sparks, most of all I like the excitement it generates with Tom driving it all along in his own cool way. Yes, it would look great as an album cover a great tribute to a great artist, well done Susan.', '2017-10-31 09:01:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541728, 1206587, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>A great image that contributes to the challenge well<br/> <br/>A lovely portrait Peter, congratulations on your high score and placing. The pose is very effective as commented it has a flowing feel to it, there is a feeling of professionalism about it everything has been carefully prepared. The lighting is nice and even, she looks really lovely. The dress does have a vintage feel to it and as such I think perhaps if we could have seen more of it it would have filled the theme even more, we need your comments to highlight it for us, it might also have helped to identify her as American?</td>', 'Hello from the critique club A great image that contributes to the challenge well A lovely portrait Peter, congratulations on your high score and placing. The pose is very effective as commented it has a flowing feel to it, there is a feeling of professionalism about it everything has been carefully prepared. The lighting is nice and even, she looks really lovely. The dress does have a vintage feel to it and as such I think perhaps if we could have seen more of it it would have filled the theme even more, we need your comments to highlight it for us, it might also have helped to identify her as American?', '2017-10-31 09:10:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541741, 1206882, 141319, '<td valign="top">This truly is a beautiful portrait of a beautiful person. You did not use any fill in flash?</td>', 'This truly is a beautiful portrait of a beautiful person. You did not use any fill in flash?', '2017-10-31 13:59:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541742, 1206621, 141319, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Great to see "little cameras" do well :-)<br/></td>', 'Congrats! Great to see "little cameras" do well :-)', '2017-10-31 14:00:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541748, 1206882, 34171, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kasaba:</b></div><hr/><i> This truly is a beautiful portrait of a beautiful person. You did not use any fill in flash? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you so much.  All natural light and no reflectors etc.  Just exposed for her face, but I did place her partially in a shadow of a tree, but left her head right on the edge to get the backlight.</td>', 'Originally posted by kasaba: This truly is a beautiful portrait of a beautiful person. You did not use any fill in flash?  Thank you so much.  All natural light and no reflectors etc.  Just exposed for her face, but I did place her partially in a shadow of a tree, but left her head right on the edge to get the backlight.', '2017-10-31 16:22:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7541778, 1206621, 60862, '<td valign="top">Woohoo, Deb!<br/> <br/>This is yet another one of yours that I wish I''d taken. :)</td>', 'Woohoo, Deb! This is yet another one of yours that I wish I''d taken. :)', '2017-10-31 21:26:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7543555, 1206743, 113591, '<td valign="top">Marve-bluddy-lous..</td>', 'Marve-bluddy-lous..', '2017-11-09 11:13:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7558527, 1206861, 25190, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1195127" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2426/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1195127.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2426/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1195127.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2426/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1195127.jpg"/></a> <br/>I know how u feel Susan. Your image is  amazing wish I had that talent. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-02-09 18:23:23.</i></td>', ' I know how u feel Susan. Your image is  amazing wish I had that talent. ', '2018-02-09 18:22:04.000000', '2018-02-09 18:23:23.000000', 0);
